Status: R
X-Status: 
X-Keywords:                  
X-UID: 1242

Shall LaTeX2e continue the use of magnified cm-fonts ?

With optical scaled fonts at each size, LaTeX documents look much better.

Since these are available both for the OT1 fontencoding (Sauter tools) and
the new T1 fontencoding (edit dcstdedt.tex appropriately), there is no need
to stay with any fonts \magstepwhatever.

May I ask the LaTeX3 team to make the Sauter fonts default for LaTeX2e ?

--J"org Knappen.

P.S. I configured LaTeX2e at our site to use the Sauter fonts, making the
font definition files very compact. However, some trial definitions do not
work, see the snippet below.

